SUMMARY:Washington Plaza Hotel (3 nights)
LOCATION:Washington Plaza Hotel\, 10 Thomas Circle NW\, Washington\, DC 20005
DESCRIPTION:Superior 1 queen\, 2 guests\, 3 nights\, prepaid via Chase Travel. Free cancellation until Wed Nov 18\, 3 PM hotel time. Call Thu Nov 19 re ~1 AM arrival\; confirm Sat overnight parking rate\; checkout Sun before 9 AM (bags in car).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-monument-tickets@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261119T200000Z
DTEND:20261119T203000Z
SUMMARY:Book Washington Monument tickets (Recreation.gov release)
LOCATION:Online (Recreation.gov)
DESCRIPTION:Recreation.gov releases more Washington Monument tickets at 3:00 PM ET. 2 tickets\, any midday time\, $1 each. Fallback: free same-day tickets at the Monument Lodge Fri from 8:45 AM. The Monument stamp is at the Lodge desk and needs no ticket.
END:VEVENT
