BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-capitol@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261120T200000Z
DTEND:20261120T210000Z
SUMMARY:U.S. Capitol Tour (booked)
LOCATION:U.S. Capitol Visitor Center
DESCRIPTION:Booked free timed-entry tour. Arrive at the Capitol Visitor Center at 2:45 PM. Covers the Crypt\, Rotunda and National Statuary Hall. Not an NPS passport site - no stamp here.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-archives@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261120T214500Z
DTEND:20261120T223000Z
SUMMARY:National Archives Museum (booked\, Rotunda entry)
LOCATION:National Archives\, 701 Constitution Ave NW
DESCRIPTION:Booked timed-entry tickets. Arrive by 4:30 and use the pre-ticketed line on Constitution Ave. Rotunda only - museum closes 5:30 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-night-walk@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261121T003000Z
DTEND:20261121T023000Z
SUMMARY:Night lights walk (free)
LOCATION:National Mall\, Washington DC
DESCRIPTION:Metro to Foggy Bottom\, then Lincoln - Vietnam - Korean War - DC War - MLK - FDR - Jefferson (~1.8 miles). Metro home from Smithsonian.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-whvc@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261121T140000Z
DTEND:20261121T150000Z
