DESCRIPTION:Booked timed entry 10 AM - theatre + Petersen House. Stamps for Ford's Theatre NHS + Pennsylvania Avenue NHS at the bookstore.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-clara-barton@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261121T161500Z
DTEND:20261121T170000Z
