BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-douglass@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261121T203000Z
DTEND:20261121T213000Z
SUMMARY:Frederick Douglass Home tour (booked\, 3:30 PM)
LOCATION:Frederick Douglass NHS\, 1411 W St SE\, Anacostia
DESCRIPTION:Booked 3:30 PM house tour. Arrive at the visitor center by 3:00 PM for tickets\, stamps and exhibits. Ask for the full partner set (Bethune\, Woodson\, Capitol Hill Parks\, National Capital Parks-East). Site closes 4:30 PM.
END:VEVENT
