DTEND:20261122T020000Z
SUMMARY:Enterprise rental pickup at DCA (booked)
LOCATION:Enterprise\, Reagan National Airport (DCA)\, Terminal Garage A
DESCRIPTION:Booked rental pickup. Compact\, unlimited mileage. Drive back to the hotel\; hotel parking is paid - confirm the overnight rate at check-in.
END:VEVENT
