DTSTART:20261122T140000Z
DTEND:20261122T144000Z
SUMMARY:Theodore Roosevelt Island
LOCATION:Theodore Roosevelt Island\, Washington DC
DESCRIPTION:Trail-map brochure in the trailhead box (stock varies). Stamp location varies - ask a ranger. Free parking at the footbridge lot.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-lbj-grove@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261122T145000Z
DTEND:20261122T150500Z
SUMMARY:Lyndon Baines Johnson Memorial Grove
LOCATION:Lady Bird Johnson Park\, Columbia Island
DESCRIPTION:No stamp desk here - its stamp is at the Arlington House bookstore. Park in the free Columbia Island Marina lot\; leave the car here for the Pentagon walk.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-pentagon@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261122T150500Z
DTEND:20261122T154500Z
SUMMARY:National 9/11 Pentagon Memorial
LOCATION:Pentagon Memorial\, Arlington VA
DESCRIPTION:On foot from the LBJ Grove car (~15 min each way over the Boundary Channel footbridge). No public parking at the Pentagon.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-arlington@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261122T160000Z
DTEND:20261122T171500Z
SUMMARY:Arlington National Cemetery + Arlington House
LOCATION:Arlington National Cemetery\, Arlington VA
DESCRIPTION:Bookstore: LBJ Grove + Arlington House + Theodore Roosevelt Island stamps. Welcome Center garage parking is paid ($1.75/hr first 3 hrs). Changing of the Guard at 12 PM.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-georgetown@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261122T173000Z
DTEND:20261122T183000Z
SUMMARY:C&O Canal + Old Stone House
LOCATION:Georgetown\, Washington DC
DESCRIPTION:C&O Canal stamp at the Georgetown Visitor Center desk\; Rock Creek Park stamp set + brochure at the Old Stone House. Free street parking - DC meters not enforced on Sundays.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dc-kenilworth@harikrishnad1997.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261113T003847Z
DTSTART:20261122T185500Z
DTEND:20261122T193000Z
SUMMARY:Kenilworth Park & Aquatic Gardens
LOCATION:Kenilworth Park & Aquatic Gardens\, 1550 Anacostia Ave NE
DESCRIPTION:The ONLY place for the Anacostia Park stamp. Ask for the partner set (Capitol Hill Parks\, Civil War Defenses\, Baltimore-Washington Parkway\, Potomac Heritage\, NACE).
END:VEVENT
